anage transactions, listings, marketing materials, lead generation efforts, and document handling tasks.\n\n.\n \n**Skills:**\n\n1. **Transaction Coordination:** Proficiency in managing real estate transactions from open to close, including document management, communication with clients and other parties, and ensuring compliance with regulations.\n\n2. **Real Estate Knowledge:** Understanding of CAD real estate laws, regulations, and processes related to transactions, listings, contract drafting, and document handling.\n\n3. **Software Proficiency:**\n- SkySlope: Ability to navigate and utilize SkySlope for document management and transaction coordination.\n- kvCORE: Proficiency in using kvCORE for lead management, client communication, and marketing automation.\n- Canva: Skill in creating visually appealing graphics and marketing materials for social media and listings.\n- Matrix: Familiarity with Matrix MLS system for property searches, listings management, and market analysis.\n\n4. **Lead Generation:** Knowledge and experience in lead generation strategies, including LinkedIn lead generation, online advertising, networking, and client referrals.\n\n5. **Social Media Management:** Ability to manage social media accounts effectively, including content creation, posting schedules, community engagement, and analytics tracking.\n\n6. **Content Creation:** Skill in creating engaging and informative content for social media posts, blog articles, email newsletters, and other marketing materials.\n\n7. **Document Handling:** Proficiency in handling real estate documents, contracts, agreements, disclosures, and other paperwork involved in transactions, listings, and client communication.\n\n--- Import Info ---\nDeal Owner: admin@stafflyhq.ai	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-11-19 14:35:04.661+00	\N
