ith running and managing paid social media campaigns.\n\n5. **Communication Skills**\n- Excellent written and verbal communication skills.\n- Ability to engage and interact with the audience effectively.\n- Strong interpersonal skills to collaborate with a large team.\n\n6. **Organizational Skills**\n- Ability to manage multiple social media accounts and campaigns.\n- Strong project management skills.\n- Efficient time management to handle a high volume of work.\n\n7. **Technical Proficiency**\n- Proficiency in social media management software (mandatory):\n\n- Understanding of SEO and web traffic metrics.\n\n8. **Experience and Expertise**\n- At least 3-4 years of experience in social media strategy and management.\n- Previous experience strategizing for real estate professionals.\n\n--- Import Info ---\nDeal Owner: admin@stafflyhq.ai	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-11-19 14:35:04.662+00	\N
