e681a237-13ba-4a2a-a172-57761caabd9a	RICHARD POBRE EXP REALTY	uncontacted	\N	\N	\N	20408f90-187e-4a07-af70-09f5a50e1547	798a8cf0-92e8-4d70-8401-bc05ec45e1a2	2025-11-19 14:35:06.84104+00	2025-11-19 14:35:06.84104+00	985f8cd2-b1c9-4a06-a9ac-63f80d854f38	medium	open	\N	\N	USD	PST	\N	\N	\N	\N	0	\N	MD	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Rate Agreed Peviously: $15/hr | Hours: 1 20hrs (Social Media Strategist) & 1 20HRS (ADMIN) | Notes: ### Task List for a Real Estate Investor Virtual Social Media Strategist\n#### Tasks\n\n1. **Social Media Strategy Development**\n- Develop and implement a comprehensive social media strategy.\n- Identify key goals, target audience, and performance metrics.\n- Adjust strategies based on analytics and performance insights.\n\n2. **Content Creation and Posting**\n- Create high-quality lifestyle reels, educational reels, and real estate carousels.\n- Edit videos using tools like Canva and CapCut.\n- Ensure all content aligns with the brand’s voice and aesthetic.\n- Increase video postings from 2-3 per week to 4-5 per week.\n- Post content daily to maintain a strong online presence.\n\n3. **Brand Building**\n- Develop and maintain a consistent brand voice and aesthetic across all platforms.\n- Engage with followers and build a community around the brand.\n- Position the brand effectively within the real estate market.\n\n4. **Trend Acclimation**\n- Monitor and adapt to current trends in the real estate industry.\n- Create content that leverages these trends to increase engagement.\n- Stay updated with social media trends and platform updates.\n\n5. **Content Calendar Management**\n- Update and maintain a content calendar to ensure timely posting.\n- Plan content in advance to align with strategic goals and trends.\n- Coordinate with the team to ensure a smooth content creation process.\n\n6. **Engagement and Interaction**\n- Engage with followers through comments, messages, and reposts.\n- Foster a sense of community and trust with the audience.\n- Respond to inquiries and provide information about properties and services.\n\n7. **Analytics and Reporting**\n- Track and analyze social media performance using analytics tools.\n- Generate regular reports on key metrics (engagement, reach, conversions).\n- Adjust strategies based on data-driven insights to improve performance.\n\n8. **Collaboration and Communication**\n- Work closely with the real estate team to gather content ideas and updates.\n- Provide feedback and guidance to improve overall content quality.\n- Coordinate with other marketing efforts and campaigns.\n\n9. **Quality Control**\n- Review all content to ensure it meets high-quality standards.\n- Make improvements based on feedback and performance data.\n- Ensure all content is accurate, relevant, and visually appealing.\n\n\n### Task List for a Real Estate Investor Admin VA Specialized in EXP Realty Softwares\n\n#### Tasks\n\n1. **Transaction Coordination**\n- Manage all aspects of real estate transactions from listing to closing.\n- Prepare and review contracts, disclosures, and other transaction documents.\n- Ensure compliance with all regulatory and company requirements.\n- Coordinate with clients, agents, lenders, and other parties to ensure smooth transactions.\n- Track transaction timelines and ensure all deadlines are met.\n\n2. **Administrative Support**\n- Handle incoming calls, emails, and correspondence professionally.\n- Schedule appointments, meetings, and property showings.\n- Maintain organized records and files for easy access and retrieval.\n- Assist in the preparation of reports, presentations, and marketing materials.\n\n3. **EXP Realty Software Management**\n- Utilize SkySlope for transaction management and document storage.\n- Use kvCORE for CRM, lead management, and marketing automation.\n- Create and design marketing materials using Canva.\n- Manage property listings and client information in Matrix.\n- Set up and manage workflows and automations in Go High Level.\n\n4. **Data Management and Reporting**\n- Enter and update data in relevant systems and spreadsheets.\n- Generate and analyze reports to support business decisions.\n- Maintain accurate and up-to-date records of client interactions and transactions.\n\n5. **Client and Team Communication**\n- Serve as the point of contact for clients during the transaction process.\n- Provide regular updates to clients and agents on the status of transactions.\n- Coordinate with team members to ensure alignment and efficient workflow.\n\n6. **Marketing Support**\n- Assist with the creation and distribution of marketing materials and campaigns.\n- Manage social media accounts and online presence.\n- Support the planning and execution of open houses and other events.\n\n7. **Technology and Tools**\n- Stay updated with the latest features and updates in EXP Realty software.\n- Troubleshoot and resolve any technical issues related to the software tools.\n- Provide training and support to team members on the use of these tools.\n #### Skills for a social media strategist (luxury) \n\n1. **Social Media Strategy and Management**\n- Expertise in creating and executing social media strategies.\n- Experience in brand building and enhancing online presence.\n- Familiarity with real estate industry trends and social media best practices.\n\n2. **Content Creation**\n- Proficiency in graphic design tools such as Canva and video editing software like CapCut.\n- Ability to create lifestyle reels, educational reels, and real estate carousels.\n- Strong skills in video editing and creating engaging visual content.\n\n3. **Brand Building**\n- Ability to develop and maintain a consistent brand voice and aesthetic.\n- Experience in growing a brand’s presence on social media.\n- Understanding of how to position a brand in the real estate market.\n\n4. **Trend Acclimation**\n- Ability to identify and leverage current trends in the real estate industry.\n- Experience in creating trendy and relevant content that resonates with the target audience.\n\n5. **Organizational Skills**\n- Strong project management skills to handle multiple content streams.\n- Efficient in updating and maintaining a content calendar.\n- Excellent time management skills to meet posting schedules and deadlines.\n\n6. **Communication Skills**\n- Excellent written and verbal communication skills.\n- Ability to engage and interact with followers effectively.\n- Strong interpersonal skills to collaborate with the team.\n\n7. **Technical Skills**\n- Proficiency in using social media management tools (e.g., Hootsuite, Buffer, Sprout Social).\n- Familiarity with analytics tools to track performance and adjust strategies.\n\n8. **Attention to Detail**\n- High attention to detail to ensure high-quality content.\n- Ability to review and improve content based on feedback.\n\n\n\nSkill List for a Real Estate Investor Admin VA Specialized in EXP Realty Softwares\n\nSkills\n\nEXP Realty Software Proficiency\n\nAdvanced knowledge and experience with EXP Realty tools such as SkySlope, kvCORE, Canva, Matrix, and Go High Level.\nProficiency in Microsoft Excel for data management and reporting.\nStrong computer literacy with the ability to quickly learn new software and tools.\nTransaction Coordination\n\nExpertise in managing real estate transactions from start to finish.\nAbility to handle contracts, paperwork, and compliance with ease.\nFamiliarity with the transaction processes for luxury realtors.\nAdministrative Skills\n\nExcellent organizational skills to manage multiple tasks and deadlines.\nStrong attention to detail to ensure accuracy in all tasks.\nEffective time management to prioritize and handle various administrative duties.\nCommunication Skills\n\nExcellent verbal and written communication skills. (NO ACCENT)\nProfessional phone manner for handling calls and client interactions.\nAbility to communicate effectively with clients, agents, and team members.\nExperience\n\nAt least 3 years of experience working with a luxury realtor or any realtor.\nProven track record in a similar administrative role within the real estate industry.\n\n--- Import Info ---\nDeal Owner: admin@stafflyhq.ai	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-11-19 14:35:04.662+00	\N
