appointments.\n- Prepare and distribute reports and documents.\n- Perform general office duties as needed.\n\n9. **Communication and Engagement:**\n- Answer and manage phone calls professionally.\n- Engage with the client's personal WhatsApp social circle and groups.\n- Convert social interactions into potential leads.\n\n \n### Skills\n\n1. **Software Proficiency:**\n- **Skyslope:** Advanced skills in managing real estate transactions, compliance tracking, document management, and task management.\n- **kvCORE:** Proficiency in using kvCORE for lead generation, client management, property listings, and marketing automation.\n- **MailChimp:** Experience in creating and managing email marketing campaigns, including audience segmentation and performance analysis.\n- **MLS (Multiple Listing Service):** Ability to search, list, and update property listings on MLS.\n- **CRM Management (Follow Up Boss):** Strong organizational skills to maintain and update CRM, track client interactions, and schedule follow-ups.\n\n2. **Social Media Management:**\n- **Platforms:** Proficient in Instagram (IG), Facebook (FB), TikTok (TT), and especially active on FB Marketplace.\n- **Content Creation:** Ability to create engaging content, including graphics, videos, and posts.\n- **Branding:** Skills in developing and enhancing personal branding through social media.\n- **Engagement:** Experience in engaging with followers, responding to comments/messages, and growing social media presence.\n- **Analytics:** Ability to track and analyze social media performance metrics.\n\n3. **Communication Skills:**\n- Clear and professional verbal and written communication skills.\n- No accent requirement for engaging with the client's personal WhatsApp social circle and groups.\n- Strong interpersonal skills to build relationships and turn interactions into leads.\n\n4. **Transaction Coordination:**\n- Expertise in coordinating real estate transactions from start to finish.\n- Ability to manage timeline