arly review and refine cold calling scripts and techniques.\n- Seek feedback and participate in training to improve sales skills.\n\n \n### Skills (NO ACCENT) \n\n1. **Cold Calling Expertise:**\n- Extensive experience in cold calling, particularly in the tech or software development industry.\n- Ability to handle rejection and continue making calls with a positive attitude.\n- Proficiency in using scripts while being able to adapt the conversation based on the prospect’s responses.\n\n2. **Sales Background:**\n- Experience in a highly competitive sales environment.\n- Proven track record of meeting and exceeding ambitious KPIs.\n- Strong negotiation and persuasion skills to convert leads into opportunities.\n- Ability to quickly understand and communicate the value proposition of software products.\n\n3. **Communication Skills:**\n- Clear and professional verbal communication with no accent.\n- Excellent listening skills to understand the needs and concerns of potential clients.\n- Strong written communication skills for follow-up emails and reporting.\n\n4. **Lead Generation:**\n- Expertise in identifying and qualifying high-potential leads.\n- Experience in generating leads through various channels, including cold calling.\n- Ability to research and identify new leads in the software development market.\n\n5. **CRM Management:**\n- Proficiency in using CRM software to track calls, manage leads, and follow up on prospects.\n- Ability to maintain accurate and up-to-date records of all interactions with leads.\n\n6. **KPI Management:**\n- Ability to consistently meet or exceed ambitious KPIs, including call volume, conversion rates, and lead generation targets.\n- Experience in working towards daily, weekly, and monthly sales goals.\n\n7. **Adaptability and Problem-Solving:**\n- Ability to adapt to different sales scenarios and overcome objections.\n- Strong problem-solving skills to find solutions and close deals.\n\n8. **Time Management and Organization:**\n- Excellent time management skills to handle a high volume of calls efficiently.\n- Strong organizational skills to manage multiple leads and follow-up tasks simultaneously.\n\n9. **Tech-Savvy:**\n- Proficiency in using various sales tools, CRM software, and other relevant technologies.\n- Ability to quickly learn and adapt to new software and tools.\n\n--- Import Info ---\nDeal Owner: admin@stafflyhq.ai	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-11-19 14:35:04.663+00	\N
