nBegin with part-time hours to establish workflow, tasks, and ROI before scaling up.\nOngoing Check-Ins & Adjustments\nVT MEMBER and Andre will communicate via WhatsApp or Slack to ensure the VA is meeting performance goals and to make any necessary improvements.\nJob Description for Internal Team (SOP)\nTitle: Executive Assistant (Part-Time) — Real Estate Focus\nObjective:\nTo provide organized, consistent support to Andre’s real estate business by managing CRM tasks, coordinating leads, scheduling showings, and assisting with administrative duties.\nResponsibilities:\nCRM & Lead Management: Update contact records, clean data, set drip campaigns, and track follow-ups.\nScheduling & Calendar Coordination: Book and confirm appointments, showings, and manage time blocks for calls.\nTransaction Coordination (Basic): Gather relevant property documents and ensure timely communication with clients and vendors.\nSocial Media (Optional): Assist with basic research and content posting if the client proceeds with podcasting or social campaigns.\nReporting & Communication: Provide daily or weekly End-of-Day reports and attend check-ins with Andre and the VT MEMBER team.\nQualifications:\nExperience: At least 1–2 years in real estate admin or VA work.\nSkills: Strong phone etiquette, CRM management (e.g., GoHighLevel, Lofty, or KV Core), scheduling, and follow-up.\nTools: Proficiency in Google Workspace (Calendar, Docs, Sheets), familiarity with DocuSign and project management tools (Trello or Asana).\nLanguage: Fluent English required; bilingual skills a plus but not mandatory.\nWorking Hours: Part-time (specific schedule TBD), aligned with Eastern Time (Florida).\n\n--- Import Info ---\nDeal Owner: admin@stafflyhq.ai\nCall Outcomes: Uncontacted	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-11-19 14:35:04.665+00	\N
